<section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> A PERSONAL LEARNING SPACE</div><div class="hero-grid"><div><h1>学一点，<br>记下来<span class="accent">。</span></h1><p class="intro">把问题想清楚，把知识连起来。<br>这里收集学习中的笔记、实验与思考。</p><a class="hero-link" href="#notes">翻开笔记 <span>↓</span></a></div><div class="notebook" aria-hidden="true"><div class="paper paper-back"></div><div class="paper paper-front"><div class="paper-top">OceanCT <span>FIELD NOTES</span></div><div class="paper-title">Ideas.<br>Experiments.<br>Understanding.</div><div class="paper-rule"></div><div class="paper-bottom">持续学习 / 持续记录 <span>↗</span></div></div><span class="paper-caption">A work in progress, always.</span></div></div></section>
<section class="notes-section" id="notes"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">THE NOTEBOOK</div><h2>学习笔记 <span class="count"><%= site.posts.length.toString().padStart(2, '0') %></span></h2></div><label class="search"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input id="note-search" type="search" placeholder="搜索笔记…" aria-label="搜索笔记标题、摘要与标签"></label></div>
<div class="notes-grid"><div class="note-list"><% if (!site.posts.length) { %><div class="empty"><span class="empty-symbol" aria-hidden="true">＋</span><h3>留一页，给下一次发现。</h3><p>新的笔记会从这里开始。<br>一个问题、一段代码，或一次终于想通的瞬间。</p><span class="empty-label">THE FIRST PAGE IS STILL OPEN</span></div><% } %><% site.posts.sort('date', -1).each(function(post) { %><%- partial('_partial/card', {post: post}) %><% }); %><p id="no-results" class="no-results" hidden role="status">没有找到相关笔记，试试其他关键词。</p></div><aside class="sidebar"><div class="side-label">ABOUT THIS SPACE</div><h3>理解，始于记录。</h3><p>给零散的想法一个落点，<br>也给未来的自己留一条线索。</p><div class="side-divider"></div><div class="side-label">在这里，你会读到</div><div class="topics"><span>技术原理</span><span>动手实践</span><span>学习随记</span></div><div class="side-bottom"><span class="dot"></span> 慢慢积累，常常回看。</div></aside></div></section>